{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29168","headline":"闻边将刘臯无辜受戮 · 许浑","name":"闻边将刘臯无辜受戮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外监多假帝王尊，威胁偏裨势不存。\n才许誓心安玉垒，已伤传首动金门。\n三千客里宁无义，五百人中必有恩。\n却赖汉庭多烈士，至今犹自伏蒲轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}